  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5soWQJH.png\" alt=\"trapdoorsmcw\" width=\"1075\" height=\"570\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&label=Twitter&logo=twitter&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&logo=discord&logoColor=f&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"about\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否曾經想過，如果 Minecraft 的每種木板變體都擁有原版風格的活板門，那該有多好？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果是的話，那你來對地方了！Macaw's Trapdoor 為每種木板變體添加了原版風格的活板門，並且</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">還增加了新的活板門類型。最新版本新增了牧場活板門、竹子活板門等更多內容！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可以在評論區或</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我們的 Macaw Discord 服務器中提出你的想法。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"video\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5rCpU9apUVw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/491l1m9yKTk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你需要一個伺服器嗎？點擊上面的圖片，使用代碼 <strong>sketchmacaw</strong> 獲得首月 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，盡情享受遊戲樂趣！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"faq\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">問：你有計劃將模組向後移植到 1.15.2 及更低版本嗎？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可能性非常低，但未來可能會有一個針對 1.12.2 的最後版本。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">問：我可以將你的模組用於我的整合包嗎？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以，只需給予我們署名並引用 CurseForge 頁面即可。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">問：我有翻譯內容要提供給你們，應該發送到哪里？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以發送到 GitHub 或我們的 Discord 服務器。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Je5qUvD.jpg\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1477\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
